0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot V4.6.1\nGodot XR Tools 4.5.0\nOpenXR Vendors Plugin 4.3.0\n\n\n\n\n### System information\n\nFedora Linux, Godot v4.6.1.stable, Meta Quest 3 or Pico 4\n\n### Issue description\n\nI noticed an application crash after updating to Godot 4.6. \n\nhttps://forum.godotengine.org/t/app-crashes-on-scene-switch/135388\n\nThe problem is setting `visible` to `false` on an `OpenXRCompositionLayerQuad` and then using Godot XR Tools to switch the scene.\n\nI previously reported the issue in the Godot XR Tools project, but learned that it probably belongs here. :)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe relevant line can be found here: https://github.com/arassec/godot-xr-sigsev-demo/blob/main/ingame_initializer.gd#L8\n\n```\n# Setting visible to false causes the crash!\nget_parent().find_child(\"OpenXRCompositionLayerQuad\").visible = false\n\n# Find the XRToolsSceneBase ancestor of the current node\nvar scene_base : XRToolsSceneBase = XRTools.find_xr_ancestor(self, \"*\", \"XRToolsSceneBase\")\nif not scene_base:\n\t\treturn\n# Request loading the next scene\nscene_base.exit_to_main_menu()\n```\n\nSetting the visibility to false and switching the scene causes the crash.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nA minimal project to reproduce the bug can be found here: \n\nhttps://github.com/arassec/godot-xr-sigsev-demo\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscription